{"steam_appid":4030830,"steam_name":"Focus Grove","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4030830/1587535242/839215c13c8fcde4d888b8f6627bc3db242964a0/1780316056/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1780329081","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257338907/eca71ea306d84401707d8ca1e24892206f41d6f9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1780329081","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/90862f983b03a80bdbf62f54d4da869bd580282b/ss_90862f983b03a80bdbf62f54d4da869bd580282b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788885535","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/d8900b9fba1c56aa739733810795eca934152885/ss_d8900b9fba1c56aa739733810795eca934152885.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788885535","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/f83623dee91a0c8565c53803fcc5a93c57bdf4d0/ss_f83623dee91a0c8565c53803fcc5a93c57bdf4d0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788885535","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/69db46c180067ace6fa30544cd2c8baceffa6dfb/ss_69db46c180067ace6fa30544cd2c8baceffa6dfb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788885535","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/a873885b29569361f1b2c1eda6773ea7e4a7865f/ss_a873885b29569361f1b2c1eda6773ea7e4a7865f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788885535"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus Grove isn’t just a game — it’s your companion for staying mindful, balanced, and productive throughout the day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/extras/0a06212aa16efa0e89f12f4cfe56bc3f.avif?t=1788885535\" width=1500 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/extras/6d8932272d0483a56ff5ce5dd6311ab6.poster.avif?t=1788885535\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/extras/6d8932272d0483a56ff5ce5dd6311ab6.webm?t=1788885535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/extras/6d8932272d0483a56ff5ce5dd6311ab6.mp4?t=1788885535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay on top of things with focus and planning tools that help you organize your work, studies, chores, and all the small things in between.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/extras/cec30c63eb10df5975293e4373685aba.avif?t=1788885535\" width=1500 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/extras/bc2b2bca7957ed2ec7ae3a9ee16addbc.poster.avif?t=1788885535\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/extras/bc2b2bca7957ed2ec7ae3a9ee16addbc.webm?t=1788885535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/extras/bc2b2bca7957ed2ec7ae3a9ee16addbc.mp4?t=1788885535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your real-life tasks to unlock a whole world of rewards for you and your Woodlings. Discover new animals, countless hats and dresses, skins for your Tree House and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/extras/a958bc81b416b540b1053a9cadb602ad.avif?t=1788885535\" width=1500 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/extras/99472c5b095c81ba72086c499ce26c32.poster.avif?t=1788885535\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/extras/99472c5b095c81ba72086c499ce26c32.webm?t=1788885535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/extras/99472c5b095c81ba72086c499ce26c32.mp4?t=1788885535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set up your tools to match the way you work. Adjust your layout freely for focus sessions, study time, planning, YouTube, or whatever your day needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/extras/cc5c8a376ef978ab97899a504717858b.avif?t=1788885535\" width=1500 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/extras/ccf4eba7b9745d2d02877258fdfe808d.poster.avif?t=1788885535\" width=1170 height=614 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/extras/ccf4eba7b9745d2d02877258fdfe808d.webm?t=1788885535\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4030830/extras/ccf4eba7b9745d2d02877258fdfe808d.mp4?t=1788885535\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every completed task helps your cozy forest farm grow. Build up your farm and a lively village for your Woodlings, expand your space, and watch your progress turn into a place full of life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍅  Pomodoro Timer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✅  Task tracker</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵  Ambient nature sounds for better focus</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📊  Habits tracker</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📝  Notepad with tabs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👨‍🌾  Relaxing no-stress farming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐰  Cute Woodling companions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧘‍♀️  Tips from personal growth trainer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📊  Work statistics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐠  Fishing album</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🖥️  Adjustable tools layout</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⌚  Gentle growth reminders</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A word for you from Little Lantern</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;We made Focus Grove because we know how hard it can be to stay motivated, make daily work feel fun, and keep a healthy balance between work and life. We struggled with this ourselves, too. That’s why we wanted to create something gentle, cozy, and helpful — something that makes it easier to move forward step by step, one carrot at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay focused, stay cozy, stay happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Little Lanterns&quot;</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2500 / AMD FX-6300 or similar<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 650 / AMD Radeon HD 7750 (2 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2500 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600K / AMD Ryzen 5 1600 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 / AMD Radeon R9 280 (4 GB VRAM)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2500 MB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Little Lantern"],"publishers":["Little Lantern"],"release_date":"Jun 1, 2026"}